00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.620
What if I was to tell you,

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.660
one of your habits will
only shorten your life

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:40.850
by maybe, five years.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.720
You were gonna live to 100, now 95.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:45.320
