that, you're gonna have

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.120
to be on oxygen, you won't
be able to breathe well,

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:48.953
you won't be able

00:00:48.953 --> 00:00:51.480
to run around with your
kids and grandchildren.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:52.880
That's an important factor, isn't it?

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.900
- Couple weeks ago, we
