tests are largely useless.

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:25.620
Not saying genetic tests
are largely useless,

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:26.970
'cause there's absolutely a role for it.

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:28.060
We actually have geneticists

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:31.310
that work in hospitals that
help with genetic planning.

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:33.000
If you have a genetic condition

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:33.960
that you wanna make sure

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.830
