00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:41.210
But, the ones that are
commercially available

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:42.550
to tell you how long you'll live,

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:44.520
not only are they terribly inaccurate

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.010
