00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:48.740
that can go on in one's life,

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:51.150
they also don't test for everything.

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:54.250
And, at times, can give you
a false sense of security

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:56.763
that ultimately ends up
worsening your behaviors.

