00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.520
- And not only does it affect your heart,

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.860
it also affects your brain.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:40.310
I feel like as we come to terms
with the sleep deprivation

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.180
that we currently face in our society,

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:44.680
we'll come to terms with the idea

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:49.090
that Alzheimer's, and all of
these neurological disorders

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:51.990
that are on the rise can
be potentially fueled

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.790
by the lack of sleep that
our society's getting.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:57.590
- Often, we think about aging
with physical health only.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.870
How much does mental
health actually affect,

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:00.720
how long you'll live?

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:01.553
- It's huge, yeah.

00:08:01.553 --> 00:08:03.630
It can end up increasing
our risk of heart disease.

