four, five, six years of age,

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.240
that's when it becomes a problem.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.370
It's a chronic issue.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:34.060
- There is a healthy level
of stress that you can have

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:34.893
where it's like,

00:08:34.893 --> 00:08:36.350
